00:23:49.360 --> 00:23:52.630
<i>The people place great hope
in the Estates-General...</i>

00:23:52.630 --> 00:23:54.220
<i>...and Oscar applauds their cause.</i>

00:23:54.960 --> 00:23:59.100
<i>However, threatened by the influence
of the Third Estate representatives,</i>

00:23:59.100 --> 00:24:02.910
<i>the royal household and nobility order Oscar
to close all access to the Estates-General,</i>

00:24:02.910 --> 00:24:05.030
<i>which further deepens Oscar's anguish.</i>

